  "title": "PDQ Hot Beef Sandwiches",
  "description": "An original recipe from my good friend Vicki! She isn't very computer literate so asked me to post this. I made this for Christmas and it was a hit! Can be prepared the day before which makes it very handy for busy holidays!",
